kate-quickrun (1.0.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix debian/watch regex to match GitHub's actual tag download URLs.
  * Fix Maintainer name mismatch between debian/control and changelog
    trailer that was misdetected as an NMU.
  * Drop erroneous executable bit on debian/{changelog,control,copyright}.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4.
  * Add Vcs-Browser/Vcs-Git and debian/upstream/metadata.
  * Add Upstream-Contact to debian/copyright.
  * Fix duplicate "Quick Run" entry in the Tools menu: the compile-and-run
    action was being auto-added by Kate's plugin system regardless of the
    XML gui definition. Moved the Ctrl+F5 shortcut to the destination
    action, which is now the only entry shown in the menu.

 -- Wyllian Bezerra da Silva <wyllianbs@gmail.com>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 12:00:00 -0300

